  "callout": {
    "title": "Badges, start, and stop",
    "body": "DEL = delete this leftover. CMB = combine with its sibling (two live funnels, live/commit stamps, extra Rust parsers). RM = remove the alias or leak, keep the story. A green triangle on the left is a path start (local canvas, or the remote window chip). A red octagon on the right is a path stop. Both stay hidden until a hover isolates a path that actually begins or ends there."
